      "title": "Vercel CLI lets AI agents search and stage domain purchases",
      "summary": "Vercel updated its CLI to allow agents to discover, check availability, and price domains automatically, while requiring explicit human intervention to complete the final purchase.",
      "design_implication": "In an agent permissions flow, developers often face an all-or-nothing autonomy toggle. When tooling decouples read-only preparation from destructive spending, interfaces must present staged approval checkpoints that summarize agent intent, pricing, and parameters before execution.",
      "implication_lens": "trust_and_risk",
      "visual_need": "illustrate",
      "source_name": "Vercel Blog",
