      "title": "NN/g study finds AI power users abandon unorganized context libraries",
      "summary": "Research from Nielsen Norman Group reveals that experienced Claude power users rarely edit their context files and frequently cannot find them, indicating significant friction in managing context libraries.",
      "design_implication": "A designer configuring an agent workspace often tucks custom instructions into obscure account settings. When power users abandon prompt files because retrieval is broken, tools must transition from hidden configuration files toward modular context drawers surfaced directly beside the prompt.",
